ulullaha raci'dir. Böyle hıtab esnasında gaib zamiri Peygamberin şanına bir ta'zîm ifade eder. Ya'ni Peygamberin ya rab! ya rab! diye duâ etmesî hakkı için söylerim ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 43.4 43.4 43.4 61.4 61.4 72.0 72.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 61.4 78.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şunlar - şu mekre kalkışan müşrikler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"123\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 122.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.0 42.0 48.7 48.7 48.7 57.0 57.0 63.7 84.7 84.7 91.4 91.4 99.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 68.2 99.7 106.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> iymana gelmez kimselerdir. 89. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"305\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 305.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.6 91.6 91.6 111.7 127.6 127.6 127.6 134.3 166.6 166.6 177.0 177.0 183.7 201.0 201.0 210.0 210.0 218.3 218.3 225.0 243.0 243.0 255.0 261.7 261.7 275.3 282.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 44.3 57.7 73.6 99.7 99.7 111.7 139.6 146.3 146.3 183.7 225.0 255.0 282.0 288.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> </p><p>Şimdi bu sûrei «zuhruf» un hatimesi olan işbu «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"108\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 108.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 21.7 21.7 30.7 37.6 37.6 44.3 60.0 78.0 78.0 98.3\" y=\"26.3\" clas